    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/fb1093667375ccc0e86e0fecf45d5e48.avif?t=1737280566\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear doesn't have to be something negative and painful, it's a fact of life. And this game lets you embrace it in an unexpectedly wholesome way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/6e9b8753a5190bd9d37758f4bd3115ff.poster.avif?t=1737280566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/6e9b8753a5190bd9d37758f4bd3115ff.webm?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/6e9b8753a5190bd9d37758f4bd3115ff.mp4?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/e3627b829fd269fabbab2b56235009f9.avif?t=1737280566\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We kept all the things that make point &amp; click fun and removed / improved the annoying stuff.<br>Oh and of course all the dialogues are fully voiced by professional actors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/0ac2c2e4c646fbbf3b8ba69e5cdefb63.poster.avif?t=1737280566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/0ac2c2e4c646fbbf3b8ba69e5cdefb63.webm?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/0ac2c2e4c646fbbf3b8ba69e5cdefb63.mp4?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/2c30664aa0e74e3634840119bdc8f7d7.avif?t=1737280566\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laika, Lexie, Bosco and Bandit need your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/8323cbeff2110bf59a1d9bd7937332b4.poster.avif?t=1737280566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/8323cbeff2110bf59a1d9bd7937332b4.webm?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/8323cbeff2110bf59a1d9bd7937332b4.mp4?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/b794704c395ca9172662c8de414be7f6.avif?t=1737280566\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful hand-painted world awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/041c8500c880da0713c9b33fd10fcb9a.poster.avif?t=1737280566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/041c8500c880da0713c9b33fd10fcb9a.webm?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/041c8500c880da0713c9b33fd10fcb9a.mp4?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/0875ee8f1d6f3484549a86d3b7643f04.avif?t=1737280566\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not on your own on this journey. Plenty of playful friends will help you along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/77090179275aa49afeef7049fe18ff8a.poster.avif?t=1737280566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/77090179275aa49afeef7049fe18ff8a.webm?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/77090179275aa49afeef7049fe18ff8a.mp4?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/c3315144a8c736698ddfe1d7e2401170.avif?t=1737280566\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of beautifully illustrated stickers awaits you. Can you find them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/ae7b883107d2387dc96a603945bfcab6.poster.avif?t=1737280566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/ae7b883107d2387dc96a603945bfcab6.webm?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/ae7b883107d2387dc96a603945bfcab6.mp4?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/cf839728af572c650f523adb0849d3b0.avif?t=1737280566\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun to the power of fun. Wait... I wonder if there's a fishing game too?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/2d3684c7c71685447348b16f79b7f672.poster.avif?t=1737280566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/2d3684c7c71685447348b16f79b7f672.webm?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/2d3684c7c71685447348b16f79b7f672.mp4?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/d5d0bc3ddfe252bdf43b5fb0419e5f6f.avif?t=1737280566\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because it tastes grate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/3dcd122e8789cd5c11a81238c9c945f5.poster.avif?t=1737280566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/3dcd122e8789cd5c11a81238c9c945f5.webm?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/3dcd122e8789cd5c11a81238c9c945f5.mp4?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/fb1093667375ccc0e86e0fecf45d5e48.avif?t=1737280566\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear doesn't have to be something negative and painful, it's a fact of life. And this game lets you embrace it in an unexpectedly wholesome way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/6e9b8753a5190bd9d37758f4bd3115ff.poster.avif?t=1737280566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/6e9b8753a5190bd9d37758f4bd3115ff.webm?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/6e9b8753a5190bd9d37758f4bd3115ff.mp4?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/e3627b829fd269fabbab2b56235009f9.avif?t=1737280566\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We kept all the things that make point &amp; click fun and removed / improved the annoying stuff.<br>Oh and of course all the dialogues are fully voiced by professional actors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/0ac2c2e4c646fbbf3b8ba69e5cdefb63.poster.avif?t=1737280566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/0ac2c2e4c646fbbf3b8ba69e5cdefb63.webm?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/0ac2c2e4c646fbbf3b8ba69e5cdefb63.mp4?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/2c30664aa0e74e3634840119bdc8f7d7.avif?t=1737280566\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laika, Lexie, Bosco and Bandit need your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/8323cbeff2110bf59a1d9bd7937332b4.poster.avif?t=1737280566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/8323cbeff2110bf59a1d9bd7937332b4.webm?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/8323cbeff2110bf59a1d9bd7937332b4.mp4?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/b794704c395ca9172662c8de414be7f6.avif?t=1737280566\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful hand-painted world awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/041c8500c880da0713c9b33fd10fcb9a.poster.avif?t=1737280566\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/041c8500c880da0713c9b33fd10fcb9a.webm?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/041c8500c880da0713c9b33fd10fcb9a.mp4?t=1737280566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 cla